    {
      "id": "5d44d1e7-98bd-4902-86ac-6ff9d355ad75",
      "name": "Where to start text",
      "type": "annotation_text",
      "parent": "583beab1-9bdc-41f2-95c0-9d12e4bcf200",
      "attrs": {
        "tags": [],
        "translate": [
          0,
          3397.1
        ],
        "rotate": 0.0,
        "scale": [
          2.6,
          2.6
        ],
        "pivot": [
          0.0,
          0.0
        ],
        "visibility": 1,
        "opacity": 1.0,
        "locked": 0,
        "text": "•  Adding plugins or running someone else’s scripts?  Read Staying Safe first (Ctrl+2): two short lessons.\n\n•  New here?  Basic Features, lessons B1 to B6, take about ten minutes.\n\n•  Know another reference tool?  Skim Advanced Features: effects, links, redaction, Steps, views, playback and scripts.\n\n•  Back after an update?  New Features covers copying attributes, editing several items at once, the colour picker, notes on single GIF frames and clickable buttons.",
        "color": [
          226,
          229,
          235
        ],
        "runs": null,
        "font_family": "",
        "font_size": 14.0,
        "bold": false,
        "italic": false,
        "underline": false,
        "strike": false,
        "highlight_color": [
          255,
