        ],
        "visibility": 1,
        "opacity": 1.0,
        "locked": 0,
        "text": "Everything on this card is yours to play with. Nothing you do here can break the guide.\n\n1   Scroll to zoom in on a picture, then press Shift+F to see them all again.\n2   Click a picture, drag a corner handle to resize it and the round knob to rotate it.\n3   Press T, click on the board and type a note. Press Esc when you are done.\n4   Press R and drag a box around a face. Press V to go back to selecting.\n5   Select two pictures with Shift+click and press G to group them. Ctrl+Shift+G ungroups.\n6   Made a mess? Ctrl+Z undoes it.",
        "color": [
          226,
          229,
          235
        ],
        "runs": null,
        "font_family": "",
        "font_size": 14.0,
