          0.0,
          0.0
        ],
        "visibility": 1,
        "opacity": 1.0,
        "locked": 0,
        "text": "Any item can carry a stack of effects. The original picture is never changed.\n\n1   The original, untouched.\n2   The same picture with an Edge Detect effect. Select it and open Attribute Editor → Effects to tune it.\n3   A Blur effect. Add effect offers grayscale, invert, threshold, posterize and more. Mix sets how strongly each applies.\n\nShift+G toggles grayscale on the selected pictures. Copy and Paste put one stack on other items.",
        "color": [
          226,
          229,
          235
        ],
        "runs": null,
        "font_family": "",
