        ],
        "pivot": [
          0.0,
          0.0
        ],
        "visibility": 1,
        "opacity": 1.0,
        "locked": 0,
        "text": "Hide a face, a name or a detail. These regions have no pixels of their own: they filter whatever is underneath.\n\n1   Pixelate (X): drag a region, then change the block size. Move the region over the picture to try it.\n2   Blur (B): drag a region, then change the strength. Shift makes it square.\n\nThey follow the picture when you move it, and exports and copies show them exactly as you see them.",
        "color": [
          226,
          229,
          235
        ],
        "runs": null,
        "font_family": "",
        "font_size": 14.0,
