        "visibility": 1,
        "opacity": 1.0,
        "locked": 0,
        "text": "GIFs and videos play right on the board. This one is already running.\n\n1   Select it and press K to pause or play. Step with , and . and jump to the ends.\n2   Click or drag along the filmstrip under the picture to scrub to a moment.\n3   It keeps its annotations. To pin a note to one frame, see lesson N4.\n\nMovies (mp4, mov, webm …) are always linked, never embedded: keep the video file next to the board.",
        "color": [
          226,
          229,
          235
        ],
        "runs": null,
