        "locked": 0,
        "text": "F1 opens every action with its keys. Search it, then rebind or add shortcuts.\n\n1   Search by name, command or key, for example Ctrl+D.\n2   Set, add or remove a shortcut. Changes are saved to keymap.toml, which also holds macros.\n\nThe Mouse & Windows tab lists every mouse gesture.",
